 ## Error Handling and Resilience Patterns {#sec-4-3}
 
+Retry only eligible transient failures, with a bounded attempt count and deadline. Honor provider retry headers, account for SDK retries, distinguish rate limits from exhausted credits, and do not retry authentication or malformed requests unchanged. A timeout can occur after a request was processed: retries may duplicate cost or actions unless idempotency is actually supported. [@openairelimits; @nygard]
